  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5901.53 Guest lecturer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5901.53 “Guest lecturer” means a person who, upon request by the EMS I/C, conducts specific classroom lectures, presentations, or demonstrations based upon his or her expertise in a given subject area.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at Chapter heading for Saf-C 5900) #12790, eff 5-24-19",
